  "body": "If you want an exceptional lifestyle with the ability to dip your toes into the ocean with the hustle and bustle of Orewa just minutes away, this is the property for you.\r\n\r\nWander the waterfront, grab a coffee and soak up the buzz of the coast, then kick off your shoes at the doorstep and walk barefoot across your own 1.247 hectares (approx.) of peace and privacy well off the road.\r\n\r\nEasy care, mature native bush surrounds this cedar-clad home with a large flat lawn made for cricket, trampolines, pets and a future pool. Recently upgraded, this luxury is ready to move straight into with double glazing, four-zone ducted heating and cooling, and beautiful new curtains and blinds throughout.\r\n\r\nStep into the impressive atrium entrance and sunlit living space. A media room, gracious formal lounge, expansive open plan kitchen, dining and second living area then open out to a vast covered deck that wraps the home leading to the lawn beyond. Slide open the kitchen window and pass the platters straight out to your guests creating effortless summer entertaining at its best.\r\n\r\nFour bedrooms and a study (or fifth room) and two bathrooms with a beautiful wide open hallway leading to the spacious master suite tucked privately away with its own deck, garden access, walk-in dressing room and ensuite.\r\n\r\nThere's room for the boat, motorhome and the trailer, with internal garaging, a full workshop and plenty of storage.\r\n\r\nDon't let this one get swept away before you've seen it - give us a call today!\r\n\r\nCall for open home viewing times.\r\n\r\nDebs Wallace and Jacqui Cantell, \r\nPremium Real Estate\r\n\r\nSet Date of Sale 3rd December 2026 at 4pm (USP)",
